    "text": "chicowildcats.com\nwebsite\nChico\n72 Wildcats Contribute to Record-Breaking CCAA All-Academic for 2024-25\nBy Chico State Athletics,\n7 hours agoALISO VIEJO, Calif. – The CCAA proudly announced a record-setting 1,150 student-athletes across the conference made up the 2024-25 All-Academic team, with 72 coming from Chico State across 13 sports. The 1,150 honorees shattered the previous record of 1,030 set a year ago. The CCAA began handing out All-Academic...",
